Specifically:

  src/meta.cpp    the opcode metadata table, from cpp/shared/command_meta_data.cpp
  src/sense.cpp   the SENSE_KEYS and ASC tables and the FormatSenseData layout,
                  from cpp/shared/s2p_util.{h,cpp}
  src/format.cpp  the hex dump layout, from cpp/shared/s2p_formatter.cpp
  src/gpio_bus.*  the pin map, phase decode and REQ/ACK handshakes, from
                  cpp/buses/board.h and cpp/buses/bus.{h,cpp}
  src/gpio_initiator.*
                  the initiator state machine and SCSI bus timings, from
                  cpp/initiator/initiator_executor.{h,cpp}
  src/gpio_bus_rpi.cpp
                  the BCM GPIO register access and board detection, from
                  cpp/pi/rpi_bus.{h,cpp}
